# Sequel repository hygiene baseline.
# Source, docs, config, and lockfiles: LF. Windows-native entrypoints: CRLF.

* text=auto eol=lf

*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf

*.sh text eol=lf

# Binary assets, archives, and camera-related artifacts.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
*.gz binary
*.bin binary
*.dex binary
*.apk binary
*.so binary